      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">come home to my heart</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œEnough games, Catra,â€ Adora said, her voice commanding. â€œThis ends now.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From her periphery, Catra studied her surroundings; her back was to a solid wall of rock, and she and Adora stood feet away from the edge of a cliff.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œWhat are you talking about?â€ Catra demanded. â€œI donâ€™t know you!â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora shoved Catra against the rocks. â€œI said,â€ she growled, â€œstop. playing. games!â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œAnd I said,â€ Catra snarled back, pushing as hard as she could, â€œI donâ€™t know what youâ€™re talking about!â€&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
